  "description": "Polygon triangulation at mesh import (12-mesh-import.md section 3, Tier 0): four non-planar quads, a pentagon and two hexagons of an OBJ; the Position mesh map baked by Painter at 512 px with the low mesh as its own high mesh (LowAsHigh), other baking parameters at their defaults, exported at 16 bits; the triangulation of each polygon is read from the baked positions. Recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen).",
